## 28. Prioritization Framework {#28-prioritization}

**Use When:** Deciding what to work on first

**Prompt Template:**
```
I have multiple competing priorities and need to decide what to focus on.

ITEMS TO PRIORITIZE:
1. [Item 1 description]
2. [Item 2 description]
